    body: "The presidents of Iran and Russia have criticised US dollar dominance ahead of the BRICS summit in India. Countering the US role in the global economy, and the effects of its war on Iran, are expected to lead the agenda as the 11-nation bloc meets on September 12.",
    content_status: "full",
